<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle $1.00  higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle $1.00  higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers opened active.  Compared to last Wednesday, early sales both classes fully $1.00 higher.  - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  Load Choice predominantly 3 near 1400 lbs old crop 65.00. High Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1400 lbs 63.00-64.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1000-1200 lbs 63.00-64.50.</p>
</text>
